sau do tao lai database va nap toan bo du lieu. Chi chay tren MAY NHAN BAN CAI DAT.
Tat backend cua may nhan truoc khi chay. Khong chay file nay tren database nguon.

CACH CHAY: SQL Server Management Studio -> mo file -> Execute (F5) TOAN BO FILE mot lan.
Khong can SQLCMD Mode, khong can chay migration rieng, khong co duong dan MDF/LDF co dinh.
Yeu cau: SQL Server 2017+ (da kiem thu tren SQL Server 2022), quyen tao/xoa database.
Neu thanh cong: ket qua 'HOAN TAT - ShoegroupDB da san sang'. Neu loi: dung va ROLLBACK
phan tao bang/nap du lieu; database cu da xoa KHONG the phuc hoi bang ROLLBACK nay.

Nguon du lieu: database/dbhientai.sql (46 bang, 577 dong, gom cac bang bak_*).
Bo sung: tat ca 7 migration den 09/09/2026, vi ShoeGroup, backfill ly do huy,
36 chi muc, trigger thong bao, BIN2 checkout key, bo dem IDENTITY hien tai.
Anh dang chuoi/base64, tai khoan va lich su duoc giu nguyen trong du lieu snapshot.
SHA256 dbhientai.sql: a3506ba7211cfe7f9ac9384917bdcdb3767716480bc0f4c018a65d7369e586f3
*/
USE [master];
SET NOCOUNT ON; SET XACT_ABORT ON; SET ANSI_NULLS ON; SET QUOTED_IDENTIFIER ON; SET ANSI_PADDING ON; SET ANSI_WARNINGS ON; SET ARITHABORT ON; SET CONCAT_NULL_YIELDS_NULL ON; SET NUMERIC_ROUNDABORT OFF;
SET IMPLICIT_TRANSACTIONS OFF;
IF @@TRANCOUNT<>0 THROW 51010, 'Hay chay file ngoai transaction dang mo.', 1;
IF CONVERT(int,SERVERPROPERTY('ProductMajorVersion'))<14 THROW 51011, 'Yeu cau SQL Server 2017 tro len.', 1;
IF ISNULL(IS_SRVROLEMEMBER('sysadmin'),0)<>1 AND ISNULL(HAS_PERMS_BY_NAME(NULL,NULL,'CREATE ANY DATABASE'),0)<>1 AND ISNULL(HAS_PERMS_BY_NAME(NULL,NULL,'CREATE DATABASE'),0)<>1 THROW 51012, 'Tai khoan SQL can quyen CREATE DATABASE.', 1;
IF DB_ID(N'ShoegroupDB') IS NOT NULL AND ISNULL(IS_SRVROLEMEMBER('sysadmin'),0)<>1 AND ISNULL(IS_SRVROLEMEMBER('dbcreator'),0)<>1 AND ISNULL(HAS_PERMS_BY_NAME(N'ShoegroupDB','DATABASE','CONTROL'),0)<>1 THROW 51013, 'Tai khoan SQL can quyen xoa database ShoegroupDB.', 1;

